---
title: Aperol Spritz
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, aperitivo]
source: Classic cocktail, number 7 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Fill a #wine glass{} with ice. Pour in @prosecco{3%fl_oz}, then @Aperol{2%fl_oz}, then top with @club soda{1%fl_oz}. Stir once, gently, and garnish with an @orange{1%slice}.

> Three, two, one: the prosecco goes in first so the Aperol does not sink.
